  "title": "How to implement ADC4",
  "content": "<p>I set PA6 and PA7 to ADC4_INx in CubeMX and ran CODE GENERATE.</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/1f3c4d02-0d0b-4259-9ad0-a21bb9882ae2.png\" /></figure><p>The generated main.c file implements MX_ADC4_Init(), but it doesn't seem to be called from anywhere.<br />Should I call this somewhere in the main statement?</p><p>Also, I tried implementing ADC reading within the main loop, but the return value of HAL_ADC_GetValue() is always 0 (even though it's actually around VDD/2).</p><p>I've attached main.c. Could you please tell me the correct implementation method?</p>",
